<font size="2" face="arial, helvetica" color=black>
<P><font size="4" face="arial, helvetica" COLOR="#990000"><b>Characters</b></font>

<p><a href="http://www.geocities.com/cyn_starwars/mirabella.jpg">
<img src="http://www.geocities.com/cyn_starwars/mirabella-sm.jpg" align=left BORDER="2" WIDTH="50" HEIGHT="50"></a>
<b>Mirabella Ebonheart:</b> "She who pushes bards off docks" and "She who's vanity exceeds 
all others", Mirabella is the leader of the Reckoners. From Erudin, she took up the sword 
in order to one day confront her dark god Cazic Thule the lord of Fear and no doubt complain 
bitterly about his ignoring her. Mirabella has slain his avatar many times in the Temple in 
Innothule and taken his loot for herself. Mirabella is the third highest Erudite Shadowknight 
on Bristlebane (Lvl 52 Reaver), not to be mistaken for Mirabelle the druid who wears whatever gear 
without caring how it looks. Mirabella cares greatly how her Plane of Growth Skirt looks. 
Hobbies: Buzzing the Platform in NRo with the Bard's 51 Selo's song up.

<p><a href="http://www.geocities.com/cyn_starwars/asiah.jpg">
<img src="http://www.geocities.com/cyn_starwars/asiah-sm.jpg" align=left BORDER="2" WIDTH="50" HEIGHT="50"></a>
<b>Asiah X'Rhai:</b> With Mirabella this Lvl 52 dark elven cleric has enslaved the bard Sharien and forced 
her to sing songs of mana where the other preferred songs of her beauty. As the cleric, Asiah 
rules the Reckoners although Mirabella has sought ways to reduce reliance upon the cleric and 
kick her out for good. Asiah developed her unique fashion senses camping Skyfire zone. Dark 
greaves and arms as opposed to the usual 'clerical gold'. Asiah only upgraded her look when she 
was awarded the purple breastplate of Hate in a raid, and later again camping Royal Velium. When Asiah's backside began to get 
abnormally large from sitting on it, Mirabella kindly informed her of this fact and hence Asiah 
may be the only 52 cleric in existence with a maxed defense skill. 
Hobbies: Melee.

<p><a href="http://www.geocities.com/cyn_starwars/sharien.jpg">
<img src="http://www.geocities.com/cyn_starwars/sharien-sm.jpg" align=left BORDER="2" WIDTH="50" HEIGHT="50"></a>
<b>Sharien SongRaven:</b> The Lvl 52 wood elf bard minstrel, provider of booze and manasong. Browbeaten from a young 
and impressionable age by Mirabella, the Bard (also known as 'BARD!') attends the Heart of the 
Night diligently when not singing for hours on end to soothe the Cleric with cool breezes. 
Clad in the usual bard motley Sharien seeks to acquire at least one complete suit of armor, 
besides her beloved gnome skin catsuit. Hobbies: Attending dragon raids and winning loot 
rolls when Mir and Asiah are not rolling against her. So far has won both red and white 
scales, and the Vox Belt of Haste.

<p><a href="http://www.geocities.com/cyn_starwars/jasada.jpg">
<img src="http://www.geocities.com/cyn_starwars/jasada-sm.jpg" align=left BORDER="2" WIDTH="50" HEIGHT="50"></a>
<b>Jasada Fairborne:</b> Twin sister and paladin of the Dark Ebonheart, Jasada is far better dressed 
and often twinks Mirabella. 
<br>Hobbies:

<p><a href="http://www.geocities.com/cyn_starwars/jasmond.jpg">
<img src="http://www.geocities.com/cyn_starwars/jasmond-sm.jpg" align=left BORDER="2" WIDTH="50" HEIGHT="50"></a>
<b>Jasmond Dvir:</b> Wood Elven warrior
<br>Hobbies: Mugging iksar bandit lords
<br><font color=white>.</font>

<p><a href="http://www.geocities.com/cyn_starwars/shannyn-eq.htm">
<b><img src="http://www.geocities.com/cyn_starwars/shannynx-sm.jpg" align=left BORDER="2" WIDTH="50" HEIGHT="50"></a>
Shannyn Daisemiin:</b> A Lvl 41 Human wizard of Solusek Ro and the first Reckoner on Tunare, she has since 
used her great powers to travel to Bristlebane and rob gnomes for clothes to wear. Shannynx as she is now 
known, has spent years working on her faction and is almost neurotic on the topic. 
<br>Hobbies: Clothes! Eight robes is not enough.

<p><a href="http://www.geocities.com/cyn_starwars/evian.jpg">
