<p><font size="4" face="arial, helvetica" COLOR="#990000"><b>Everquest History</b></font>
<p>
Over Halloween weekend the Bard incited many Reckoners to the quest for loot in Rathe Mountains, North Ro, and East Karana. As the corpses piled up so did the Bard's loot. 
