<p>
<a href=http://www.geocities.com/cyn_starwars/gratefulhalfling.jpg"><img src="http://www.geocities.com/cyn_starwars/gratefulhalfling-sm.jpg" align=center BORDER="2" WIDTH="128" HEIGHT="96"></a>
<p>
October 29, 2001 The Bard was presented with a token of esteem by the President of the Halfling Druid Quest Society, Uner Gnarltrunk. A Potion of Wisdom (1 charge).
<p>
<img src="http://www.geocities.com/cyn_starwars/raid-icewell-1.jpg" align=center BORDER="2" WIDTH="640" HEIGHT="480">
<p>
October 13th, the Reckoners Mirabella, Asiah, Terece, Evian invaded the Tower of Shadow to raid the wedding party, found it was camped so moved to Icewell and were joined by Belgerard and the usual corpse looters. Note the cleric is meleeing again, and Belgerard's wolfie.
<p>
<img src="http://www.geocities.com/cyn_starwars/raid-icewell-1.jpg" align=center BORDER="2" WIDTH="640" HEIGHT="480">
<p>
October 12th, 2001 the Reckoners attended the Ixablat Fer Raid in Burning Woods. Mirabella, Terece, Vuurl and Sharien. Four times the elemental was pulled and four times it died, twice we died except the Bard who only died once. At the last raid, Silvs joined us and of course the CoF dropped and HE won it. Vuurl, Terece and Mirabella all received xp from the elemental, the druid, or the wurms that were pulled between spawns.
<p>
